Boss: {
	Fortuna: {
		Intro: Every house answers to me. Place your life on the table.
		Leave: Fortuna turns her wheel to someone else.
		LastBet: LAST BET! Strike while the wheel turns!
		Jackpot: The wheel stops... JACKPOT!
		JackpotText: JACKPOT!
		HouseWins: The wheel stops... the house wins.
		Awaken: The blindfold tears. Fortune sees you.
		Death: Impossible... I hold... every... card...
		Odds: Jackpot {0}%
		Title: FORTUNA
		Subtitle: The Last Wheel
	}

	PitBoss: {
		Intro: The vault doors swing open... The Pit Boss wants a word.
		Leave: The Pit Boss cashes out and disappears into the vault.
		Bets: PLACE YOUR BETS! Red or black?
		Security: SECURITY!
		Double: Double or nothing!
		Tails: TAILS!
		Red: RED!
		Black: BLACK!
		Phase2: DOUBLE OR NOTHING!
		Phase3: BANKRUPT!
		Title: THE PIT BOSS
		Subtitle: Keeper of the Vault
	}

	WildCard: {
		Intro: The Wild Card shuffles into the night... Pick a card, any card!
		Leave: The show is over. The Wild Card vanishes in a puff of cards.
		AllIn: ALL IN! The Wild Card bets everything!
		Roll: "{0} + {1} = {2}!"
		Doubles: DOUBLES! Again!
		Found: You found me!
		Title: THE WILD CARD
		Subtitle: Jester of Fortune
	}
}

Bestiary: {
	GuardCaptain: Captain of the card guard. He only marches out when the army has lost a hundred men, and he never goes home empty-handed.
	Fortuna: Wheels within wheels, and a goddess blindfolded at the hub. Every coin ever tossed has landed at her feet.
	ThePitBoss: He runs the floor of the High Rollers casino from a flying roulette wheel. Nobody leaves his table up, not for long.
	BrokeGambler: He bet the house, then the horse, then his own heartbeat. He still swears the next spin is the one.
	LuckyBat: A cave bat that stole a gold coin from a careless miner and refuses to let go.
	RoyalGuard: The knight of spades guards the deepest card tables. Its shield is a giant playing card.
	RouletteWraith: The restless spirit of a croupier, still spinning the wheel long after the last bet.
	LoanShark: Borrow from him once and he will follow you to every beach in the world.
	Bookie: He takes bets on anything that moves, and on most things that do not.
	Magician: She used to assist The Wild Card. She knows every trick, and where the bodies reappear.
	Bouncer: Left the Pit Boss's payroll for fresh air. He still checks everyone at the door.
	TownGambler: A smooth talker in a purple suit who moved to town the day the casino opened. He has a system.
	TheWildCard: Every deck has one card that plays by its own rules. This one learned magic, and it never loses.
	ChipSlime: A poker chip that rolled away from the tables and learned to bite. It still remembers its value.
	CardSoldier: The house guard of a deck nobody plays with anymore. It marches in suits.
	SlotMimic: It pays out, eventually. Mostly it pays out teeth.
}

NPCs: {
	HowToPlay: How to play
	Stolen: Pickpocketed!

	Showgirl: {
		DisplayName: Showgirl

		Chat: {
			0: Two shows a night, every night. The House never closes, and neither do these legs!
			1: Feathers are imported. The smile is real. The tips are encouraged.
			2: The bartender says I kick higher than the slot machines pay out. He is right.
			3: Enjoy the show, sugar. Then go lose some money, it keeps the lights on.
		}
	}

	PoleDancer: {
		DisplayName: Pole Dancer

		Chat: {
			0: Six years of gymnastics, and this is where it got me. Best decision ever.
			1: Grip, spin, invert, smile. If you can do that after three cocktails, you're hired.
			2: People think it's easy. Try holding yourself upside down on a chrome pole. I'll wait.
			3: Tip the dancer, sugar. The House takes enough from you downstairs.
		}
	}

	BrokeGambler: {
		DisplayName: Broke Gambler

		Moan: {
			0: Just... one... more... spin...
			1: Red... it was supposed to be red...
			2: Lend me... a silver...
			3: The house... always wins...
			4: My lucky... coin...
		}
	}

	LuckyBat.DisplayName: Lucky Bat
	RoyalGuard.DisplayName: Royal Guard
	RouletteWraith.DisplayName: Roulette Wraith
	LoanShark.DisplayName: Loan Shark

	Togi: {
		DisplayName: Togi
		Bonus: BONUS!!! CHAT, LOOK!

		Chat: {
			0: Shh, I'm live. Say hi to chat! ...Chat says your armour is mid.
			1: One more spin. Then I stop. Probably. Definitely. One more.
			2: This machine owes me. I can feel it. The bonus is RIGHT there.
			3: Rule number one: never bet what you can't lose. Rule number two: forget rule number one, the bonus is coming.
			4: You want tips? Bet small, scream big. The machine respects energy.
			5: If I hit the jackpot, everyone in chat gets... my respect. That's priceless.
		}

		Overhead: {
			0: Chat, chat, CHAT!
			1: Come on, come on...
			2: Bonus buy? Bonus buy.
			3: That was SO close!
			4: Three sevens, I'm begging.
			5: Who's tilting? Not me.
			6: Last spin. Okay, last last spin.
			7: Subscribe for luck!
		}
	}

	CasinoVisitor: {
		DisplayName: Casino Guest

		Chat: {
			0: Just getting some air. Gotta clear my head before I double down.
			1: The roulette table is hot tonight. Or I am. One of us is.
			2: Don't tell my spouse I'm here. I'm "at the blacksmith".
			3: Fresh air! Ugh, too fresh. Back to the slots.
			4: Lost my shirt in there. Well, not literally. Yet.
			5: You going in? The bartender makes a mean Golden Chip Fizz.
		}
	}

	Bookie: {
		DisplayName: Bookie
		Service: Boss bet

		Chat: {
			0: I've got odds on everything. Rain tomorrow, three to one.
			1: The Eye of Cthulhu? Fan favourite. Never pays.
			2: Put your money where your sword is.
			3: I don't gamble. I just hold the money of people who do.
			4: A sure thing? There is no such thing. That will be fifty silver.
			5: Scratch cards are the honest game. You lose fair and square.
		}

		BetTaken: "{0} it is. Beat any boss before dawn without dying and I owe you {1}."
		BetRunning: Your bet is on. Beat a boss before dawn, stay alive, and collect {0}.
		BetTomorrow: One bet a day, friend. Come back after dawn.
		BetTooLate: The fight is already on! No late bets.
		BetPoor: The stake is {0}. Come back when you have it.
		BetWon: The Bookie pays out: {0}!
		BetLost: You died. The Bookie keeps your stake.
		BetExpired: Dawn breaks. The Bookie keeps your stake.

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: I am content.
			NoHome: I hate not having a home.
			FarFromHome: I am too far from home.
			LoveSpace: I love having so much space.
			DislikeCrowded: I dislike how crowded I am.
			HateCrowded: I hate how crowded I am.
			LikeBiome: I like {BiomeName}.
			DislikeBiome: I dislike {BiomeName}.
